      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WEREGOINGTOGETCHA (8) is in good form at present. Finished third at her latest appearance over 2230m at this track, beaten 7 metres. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. This doesn't look as hard so she is in the right race to find the winners' list. SWEET ARPEGGIO (4) was out of the money two runs back at this track then improved sharply last start to score by a nose over 1800m at the same circuit. Won't find this any harder and she can go right on with the job. CLARENDEN LEGACY (7) was out of the money two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished a distant last over 1800m at this track. Tactics will be crucial from this wide draw. Only needs to get things right to be in the money. AMYS BABY ANGEL (3) is better than her last-start run for eighth over 2230m at this track would suggest. Worth considering.",
